# Ojer Kaslem, Deepest Growth: "Whenever Ojer Kaslem deals combat damage to a player, reveal that many cards from the top of your library. You may put a creature card
# and/or a land card from among them onto the battlefield. Put the rest on the bottom in a random order." Cast on turn 1 ({3}{G}{G}: Black Lotus, Mox Emerald and a
# Forest), it hits an empty board on turn 3 for 6, so the top six cards are revealed: Memnite, Ornithopter, Mountain, Plains, Wrath of God and Lightning Bolt. The
# seventh, Grizzly Bears, is not revealed and cannot be chosen. At most one creature card and one land card: not two creatures, not two lands, nothing else.
# Bot1 puts the Memnite and the Mountain onto the battlefield; the other four go to the bottom of the library, so on turn 5 the draw is the Grizzly Bears.

